# Scripts that run on Linux (CI, servers, and the POSIX installer) must keep LF
# line endings even when the repository is checked out on Windows, otherwise
# `set -euo pipefail` fails with "invalid option name".
*.sh text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Go sources and build/release configuration must stay LF for the Go toolchain,
# GoReleaser, and container builds.
*.go text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
